## 2. Backend Logic & Validation

#### [MODIFY] [auth.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/psbon/Telecombank%20App/backend/src/auth/auth.service.ts)
- **Auto-create Business:** During OTP verification (if new user), automatically create an entry in `businesses` with `user_id` and name like "My Business".

#### [MODIFY] [transactions.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/psbon/Telecombank%20App/backend/src/transactions/transactions.service.ts)
- **Soft Delete Enforcement:** Add `WHERE deleted_at IS NULL` to ALL queries.
- **Minimal Schema:** Update [create](file:///c:/Users/psbon/Telecombank%20App/backend/src/users/users.service.ts#26-33) and [getHistory](file:///c:/Users/psbon/Telecombank%20App/backend/src/transactions/transactions.controller.ts#19-30) SQL queries to remove `payment_method`, `status`, `note`, and use `description` and `business_id` instead.
- **Data Validation:** 
  - Fail if transaction > 5 years old.
  - Fail if `transaction.type` != `category.type`.

#### [MODIFY] [create-transaction.dto.ts](file:///c:/Users/psbon/Telecombank%20App/backend/src/transactions/dto/create-transaction.dto.ts)
- Enforce strict validation via class-validator: max description length, valid amounts.

